body:
my (probably naive) view is that the procedure should look like this:
read cookies: open(filename, O_RDONLY|O_CLOEXEC), read() ; close();
write cookies: open(filename, O_WRONLY|O_CREAT|O_TRUNC|O_CLOEXEC, 0660); write() ; close();
in case you want to avoid to lose content written by other curl processes, the write step could maybe use O_APPEND instead of O_WRONLY etc.
